OL,3,ABurnham to tell MPs optimism at heart
OL,4,Aof his vision for Britain
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham will say a "sense of
OL,7,Foptimism" is at the heart of his vision
OL,8,Fabout Britain's future, in his first
OL,9,FCommons statement as prime minister on
OL,10,FTuesday.
OL,12,FThe prime minister's statement will
OL,13,Ffocus on two areas which he will say
OL,14,Fare central to his vision for growth:
OL,15,Ffirstly establishing stronger public
OL,16,Fcontrol of essential services.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,304,300,200,140,0,100
