OL,3,ANepal rescuers blast hillside in search
OL,4,Aof hydropower workers as families wait
OL,5,Aanxiously
OL,6,
OL,7,F"I wish we could find him. I wish he
OL,8,Fwould come home," Anushila Bhandari,
OL,9,Fwife of Aurus Bhandari, a 33-year-old
OL,10,Fengineer missing on a project site,
OL,11,Ftold BBC Nepali.
OL,13,FIt comes as the death toll from the
OL,14,Fflood disaster on the Nepal-Tibet
OL,15,Fborder reached 939, according to the
OL,16,Fcountry's disaster management
OL,17,Fauthority.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
